Spec: Storage Service

Purpose:
  Encapsulate all localStorage access for TODO persistence.

Structure:
  ./storage.js: Storage service implementation.

Owns:
  ./storage.js

References:
  ../models/todo.sdd

Must:
  Serialize todo arrays to JSON before writing.
  Deserialize JSON back to plain objects on read.
  Return an empty array when no stored data exists.
  Use a fixed storage key for the todo collection.

Must not:
  Import component code.
  Construct @Todo model instances; return plain objects only.
  Perform business logic.

Exposes:
  @StorageService
  @StorageService.load
  @StorageService.save

Scenario: load with no prior data
  Given localStorage has no entry for the todo key
  When load is called
  Then an empty array is returned

Scenario: round-trip persistence
  Given a list of todo plain objects
  When save is called and then load is called
  Then the returned list equals the saved list

Done when:
  Load with missing data returns an empty array.
  Save and load round-trip plain todo objects.
